OL,3,GNEWSA24-hour petrol station opening
OL,4,Aplan refused again
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to keep a petrol station open 24
OL,7,Fhours a day have been refused for the
OL,8,Fsecond time in just a few months.
OL,10,FThe Texaco filling station on Leeds
OL,11,FRoad in Shipley currently opens between
OL,12,F07:00 and 23:00 every day, but an
OL,13,Fapplication was submitted earlier this
OL,14,Fyear to extend those hours.
OL,16,FThat application was refused by
OL,17,FBradford Council, with councillors
OL,18,Fsaying the proposed opening hours would
OL,19,Fbe "anti-social".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
