OL,3,GNEWSA24-hour petrol station opening
OL,4,Aplan refused again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second application, this time
OL,7,Fincluding a noise impact assessment and
OL,8,Fmanagement plan, was submitted in the
OL,9,Fsummer, but has been refused again due
OL,10,Fto concerns about the impact on
OL,11,Fneighbours.
